**The `API-DOCS.md` file is your complete endpoint reference.** I reviewed all controllers and added the two missing sections: **Sandbox** and **WebSockets**. Here's the full map:

### 📱 Mobile App Endpoint Map (17 modules)

| Module | Base Path | Auth | Key Endpoints |
|--------|-----------|------|---------------|
| **Auth** | `/auth` | No | register, login, verify-email, forgot-password, Google OAuth |
| **Subjects** | `/subjects` | JWT | CRUD materias + schedules + tasks + notes |
| **Dashboard** | `/dashboard` | JWT | Single `GET /summary` (stats, classes, tasks, notes, gamification) |
| **Gamification** | `/gamification` | JWT | `GET /progress` (level, xp, streak, achievements) |
| **Profile** | `/profile` | JWT | Personal, academic, professional, skills, modules, 2FA, sessions, privacy, notifications config |
| **Resume** | `/resume` | JWT | CV CRUD + public slug + PDF download |
| **Resume Sub** | `/resume/experience`, `/education`, `/project`, `/certificate`, `/language` | JWT | Full CRUD on each |
| **AI Teacher** | `/ai` | JWT | chat (REST + SSE stream), conversations, goals, resources, teacher-profiles, knowledge-gaps |
| **Jobs** | `/jobs` | JWT | search (paginated + filters), save/apply, match score, discover/sync |
| **Roadmaps** | `/roadmaps` | JWT | AI-generated learning paths with Duolingo-style levels + practice quizzes |
| **Resume Analyzer** | `/resume-analyzer` | JWT | Analyze CV (upload or from profile) |
| **Study Groups** | `/groups` | JWT | Create/join/leave, sessions, chat, image upload, AI recommendations |
| **Notifications** | `/notifications` | JWT | List, unread-count, mark-read |
| **Academic Risk** | `/risk` | JWT | Risk score, history, per-subject risk, recalculate |
| **Study Timer** | `/study-timer` | JWT | Log sessions (pomodoro), weekly stats, history |
| **Sandbox** | `/sandbox` | JWT | Code exercises CRUD, attempts, stats |
| **Calendar** | `/calendar` | JWT | Events CRUD, upcoming exams, Google Calendar OAuth + sync |

### ⚡ WebSockets (Real-time)

| Namespace | Purpose | Events |
|-----------|---------|--------|
| `/notifications` | Push notifications | Listen: `notification:created` |
| `/group-chat` | Group chat | Emit: `join-room`, `leave-room`, `send-message` · Listen: `message-received` |

### 🔑 Auth Flow Summary
1. `POST /auth/register` → returns `{ access_token, user }`
2. Store `access_token` in secure storage (Keychain/Keystore)
3. Send as `Authorization: Bearer <token>` on all protected routes
4. Google OAuth: redirect to `/auth/google`, handle callback URL with token

### 🎯 Streaming SSE (AI Chat)
- `POST /ai/chat/stream` returns `text/event-stream` for real-time AI responses

---

