                  {{ res.correct }} de {{ res.total }} correctas · completado en {{ formatSeconds(res.secondsUsed) }}
                </p>
                @if (timeUp()) {
                  <p class="text-xs font-semibold mt-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full inline-block" style="background: #fef2f2; color: #b91c1c;">
